From r.w.krause at rug.nl  Thu Feb  4 07:38:34 2016
From: r.w.krause at rug.nl (Krause, R.W.)
Date: Thu Feb  4 07:38:34 2016
Subject: [statnet_help] Structural zeros between most classes of nodes?
In-Reply-To: <56B34945.1060609@ipw.unibe.ch>
References: <CAP9UTLZFBtr15_EFtMq7vrhHhUmTgn3GO+Zw_4kwQUQ7HuAFgg@mail.gmail.com>
