Hi Jeff,

I'm not going to delve into your substantive questions -- but I wanted 
to make sure you knew we now have gw-terms for directed networks in the 
most recent release of ergm 3.6:

dgwesp
dgwnsp
dgwdsp

and corresponding terms for the counts desp, dnsp, ddsp.  Documentation in 
the "ergm-terms" help.

best,
mm

