Thanks Martina.

Substantively, I think the answer to (1) is "triangle". (3) is
mathematically impossible for a single network since it would comprise a
network level covariate. It might work since I have multiple time-series
networks, but I don't think it actually adds much over using threats. So
(3) is no longer an issue.

That leaves (2). Is there a term that is equivalent to "triangle" but for a
4-cycle in which directionality does not matter, but the outcome network is
directed?

Thanks
Jeff Carnegie

