Dear Statnet experts,

there is the following note on the help page of mcmc.diagnostics():

> Recent changes in the ergm estimation algorithm mean that these plots 
> can no longer be used to ensure that the mean statistics from the 
> model match the observed network statistics.

Why is this the case, and where can I read more about this? Does it mean 
that the ...$sample object of the ergm()-result is _not_ a random sample 
from the estimated ergm?

Thanks for any help!
