the GOF of the esp distribution, it considerably worsens the fit for the
out-degree distribution. Interestingly, our attempts with dgwesp terms lead
to similarly bad outcomes for the out-degree distribution.

This is as far as we?ve gotten so far in our renewed attempts and it will
still probably take us a while to figure out the best solution, but you?ve
given us a lot of new ideas to try. Thanks for your response!

